            "en-US": "## Thank you for sharing\n\nTalking about your mental health and your relationships takes courage, and we are grateful for your time and honesty.\n\n### If you would like support\n\nIf any of these questions brought up difficult feelings, please consider reaching out for support:\n\n- **Talk to the interviewer now** if you would like to stop and take a moment.\n- **Contact your doctor or usual mental-health service.**\n- **If you are in crisis or thinking about harming yourself, please contact your local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.** _The researcher will insert the specific local and national helpline numbers for your study site here (for example, in the US: call or text 988; in the UK: Samaritans on 116 123)._\n\nYou do not have to face difficult feelings alone, and reaching out for help is a sign of strength."
